            "text": "Every order takes time and care to pack. We reuse boxes and keep costs as low as possible, but minimum orders help cover packing costs so we can keep our grocery prices affordable without losing money on orders."
          }
        },
        "column_BQbBCP": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How delivery costs work",
            "text": "Our delivery fees help cover drivers, vehicle maintenance and getting your groceries to you. Southern Gold Coast deliveries travel further from our warehouse. For areas our vans can't reach, we use a refrigerated courier, with higher transport costs and packaging we can't collect and reuse."
          }
        },
        "notice_jHPHPC": {
          "type": "notice",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "fuel",
            "heading": "Our temporary fuel levy",
            "text": "The levy helps cover the current cost of diesel. It's temporary, and we hope to remove it as diesel prices come back down.",
            "background_color": "#faf3e6",
            "icon_color": "#086c3f",
            "heading_color": "#086c3f"
          }
        },
        "notice_i9Nn3e": {
          "type": "notice",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "recycle",
            "heading": "Please return your packaging",
            "text": "For all local deliveries, please return your box and packaging so we can reuse them. This helps reduce waste and keep costs down. Thank you!",
            "background_color": "#eaf3ea",
            "icon_color": "#086c3f",
            "heading_color": "#086c3f"
          }
        }
      },
